{"seq":2,"slug":"emigration-to-america","title":"Emigration To America","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/emigration-to-america","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fleeing-nazism","title":"逃离纳粹与移居美国（1933—1943）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/emigration-to-america/fleeing-nazism","wordCount":1939,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-general-motors-study","title":"通用汽车的研究（1943—1946）","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/life-and-times/emigration-to-america/the-general-motors-study","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现德鲁克移居美国与开创管理学的关键历程。作为一位有犹太血统、且公开批判极权主义的知识分子，德鲁克为逃离纳粹而移居美国。在美国，他受邀对通用汽车公司进行了为期约两年的深入研究，写成《公司的概念》（1946年）——第一次将\"大型企业\"作为社会组织进行系统研究，是\"现代管理学\"诞生的重要标志。本章揭示德鲁克管理思想的起点。\n"}